# Trimmed to what the counter image actually needs. Workspace package manifests
# all stay: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile fails if a package the lockfile knows
# about is missing, so the blog's packages are copied even though this service
# does not serve the blog. content/ and attached_assets/ are data, not packages,
# and are the bulk of the repository — they are the ones worth leaving out.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
content
attached_assets
.git
*.log
